    "description": {
      "content": "Taxi is an open-source language for describing APIs, data models, and how data relates across an entire ecosystem. This API covers the Taxi schema compiler service, TaxiQL query execution, schema registry operations, and tooling integrations for generating Taxi schemas from existing API specifications.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Taxi Language",
